{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["whom Hagar the Egyptian bore to him — that is: this is not his son who is called by the name of his seed, but the son of a maidservance. But regarding Yitzhak it is written before us: אלה תולדות יצחק בן אברהם. How was he his son? אברהם הוליד את יצחק — that is: this is the principal offspring of Avraham, like: פרץ הוליד את חצרון, etc."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:45:08.310747146Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}